<title>CHINA: China 1996 grain output seen above 480 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>China 1996 grain output seen above 480 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's grain output is forecast to exceed 480 million tonnes in 1996 despite floods earlier this year, the Xinhua Daily Telegraph said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said improved technology had contributed to the expected rise but it gave no further details.</p>
<p>Chinese officials had previously estimated grain output at about 480 million tonnes this year, up from 466 million tonnes in 1995.</p>
</text>
